# Light infantry: open order, every man his own shot from behind whatever is there.
drill "Skirmishers"
about "Open order, every man in cover and firing at will; no volleys, no stomach for the bayonet."
type Marksman
dials aggression 0.35 discipline 0.35 cohesion 0.15 cover 0.95 patience 0.45 nerve 0.50

sergeant:
  otherwise -> fire at will

man:
  when in cover and loaded and enemy within 55 -> fire
  otherwise -> follow sergeant
